=09=09=09=09=09=09=09<br><br>

A police officer in a small town stopped a motorist who was speeding down M=
ain Street.
<br><br>
"But officer," the man said, "I can explain."
<br><br>
"Just be quiet!!!" snapped the officer.  "...or I'm going to let you cool o=
ff in jail until the chief gets back."
<br><br>
"But officer, I just wanted to say...."
<br><br>
"And I said KEEP QUIET!  Now you're going to jail!"
<br><br>
A few hours later, the officer checked up on his prisoner and said, "Lucky =
for you that the chief's at his daughter's wedding.  He'll be in a good moo=
d when he gets back."
<br><br>
"Don't count on it," said the man in the cell.  "I'm the groom!"

